== FLAGS / CAVEATS ==

1. Civil Code: Vol I of Haymond/Burch annotated first edition (1874) is on IA but only covers §1-§2079.
   Used Hart/Whitney 1880 edition instead for full coverage (§1-§3525). The 1880 amendments are
   minor constitutional adaptations; core 1872 text is preserved. Sections 3526-3543 not found —
   may be in an appendix or represent the 1879 constitutional adaptation sections.

2. CCP: Only 1872+1880 amended editions found on IA. No pure as-enacted 1872 CCP available.
   The 1880 amendments include constitutional conformance changes. Core procedural sections intact.

3. Political Code: Official 1872 State Printer (Springer) edition used — best available provenance.
   Two-volume structure: Vol1 (politicalcodest01caligoog) + Vol2 (politicalcodest00haymgoog).
   Combined coverage: 1-4505 with gaps. The Springer edition has a complex layout where sub-item
   tables (like county seat distance tables, §§150-200) produce many short single-line sections.

4. All three codes: identifiers ending in 'goog' (Google Books scans). No non-Google alternatives
   found for 1872 editions of these three codes on IA, unlike the Penal Code where we had the
   same situation (penalcodecalifo00burcgoog was also a Google scan).

